Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 15:25:54 +1000
Subject: [PATCH] VAS live-control bridge (inactive unless started by Vietnews
 AI Studio)

Local server (same-user only, per-launch token) exposing the timeline state and a fixed set of
edits (move, cut, resize, delete, insert, effect, seek, save) through the timeline model's own
request* functions with undo, so the user can Ctrl+Z every AI edit.
